---
title: "member_soft_delete (Clubhouse Manager)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_auth: check authenticated session
    q_auth --> q_error_unauth: session invalid
    q_auth --> q_check_admin: session valid
    q_check_admin --> q_error_forbidden: user is not admin
    q_check_admin --> q_validate: user is admin
    q_validate --> q_check_member: validate target member_id exists
    q_check_member --> q_error_not_found: member not found
    q_check_member --> q_check_already: member found
    q_check_already --> q_error_already: member already logically deleted
    q_check_already --> q_soft_delete: member is active
    q_soft_delete --> q_cleanup: set deleted flag via SQL (logical deletion)
    q_cleanup --> [*]: remove from active teams, return success
    q_error_unauth --> [*]: return unauthorized error
    q_error_forbidden --> [*]: return forbidden error
    q_error_not_found --> [*]: return not found error
    q_error_already --> [*]: return already deleted error

    note right of q_check_admin
        INV-001: Only admin users can delete member accounts
    end note

    note right of q_soft_delete
        INV-002: Deletion must be logical (soft delete), not physical
        INV-003: Member data must be preserved after deletion
    end note

    note right of q_cleanup
        INV-004: Logically deleted members must be removed from all team assignments
    end note
